          "kind": "daily",
          "merge_commit": "25aa14f3879d8d0abc31745757c314e5414f604a",
          "note": "SciMARS 明确改变角色规程、协调契约和可选记忆管理策略，执行候选后选择并保留下一轮 Harness；按现行定义“后续任务或改进轮次”，其任务内跨改进轮次的 Harness 更新可收。 逐项证据、分歧与纠正保留于 docs/internal/reports/maintenance-2026-11-11/。不声称复算全部论文数字。",
          "owner_login": "adongwanai",
          "promote_to_repo": false,
          "reviewed_at": "2026-11-12T07:29:09.486852+00:00",
          "reviewed_on": "2026-11-12",
          "source_hash": "5198bd9551bd2245989c8f87b54984dfee54bfa55d00fe1dd0c4d2c226d2ddf4",
          "summary_override": {
            "summary_en": "SciMARS uses execution traces and public probes to revise team role procedures, handoff contracts, and, in its memory extension, evidence-recording and retrieval policies before composing and selecting a successor harness. Retained edits govern later improvement rounds of the same task; new evaluation tasks reset adaptation, so this is not cross-task accumulation. The optimizer itself stays fixed. Scientific discovery is evaluated through experimental-data replay and a digital twin, rather than new physical wet-lab experiments.",
            "summary_zh": "SciMARS 根据执行轨迹和公开探针，分别修订多 Agent 团队的角色程序、交接契约，以及扩展版的记忆读写策略，再组合并选择下一版 Harness。被选修改用于同一任务的后续改进轮，新的评测任务会重置，不能写成跨任务积累；改进器本身保持固定。科学发现评测使用实验数据回放与数字孪生，并非新做实体湿实验。"
          },
          "week": "2026-W46"
        },
